  * Xiaomi 11T (agate, MT6893): snapshot of the Mali-G77 dependencies.
  * agategpu=1 reads controllers. agategpu=2 reads rails.
  * agategpu=3 tests MFG and reads the GPU ID at the stock boot point.
- * agategpu=4 also runs the vendor one-shot job for G77 r0p1.
+ * agategpu=4 runs the vendor one-shot job for G77 r0p1.
+ * agategpu=5 or 6 hands the initialized GPU to the IOKit accelerator.
  * Register layout cross-checked with the agate FDT and the MT6893 X6739
  * reference (hakios_mali_mt6893.h, commit 9eeec2d2e12f).
  */
@@ -384,6 +385,43 @@ agate_gpu_power_down(vm_offset_t spm, vm_offset_t infra, const struct agate_gpu_
 	return true;
